6. Primitive to Obj & Obj to primitive :

class wrapperDemo {
    public static void main (String[] args) {
        int num = 100;
        Integer object = num; // Autoboxing
        Integer number = Integer.valueOf(200);
        int value = number; // Unboxing

        System.out.println("Primitive value: " + num);
        System.out.println("Wrapper Object: " + object);
        System.out.println("Wrapper Object: " + number);
        System.out.println("Primitive value: " + value);
    }
}

Output:
Primitive value: 100
Wrapper Object: 100
Wrapper Object: 200
Primitive value: 200
